    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the absence of any provision under the principal Act on the requirement to pay fees to the Controller, the fees collected and imposed by the Controller in relation to the declaration issued under section 27a of the principal Act shall be deemed to have been validly imposed and collected during the period from 1 June 2012 to the day preceding the commencement date of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_19__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No action or legal proceedings shall be brought, instituted or maintained against the Government of Malaysia, any officer of the Government of Malaysia, the Corporation, any officer of the Corporation, or any person acting under them in respect of any fees which were charged and collected during the period referred to in subsection (1), and if any action or legal proceedings has been brought, instituted or maintained, it shall be discharged and made void and no refund in respect of the fees charged and collected as stated in this Act shall be made. Saving and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Copyright (Amendment) Act 2021."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. General amendment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Copyright Act 1987 [Act 332], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, except for subsections 27a(3) and (4), is amended by substituting for the words “licensing body” wherever appearing including in the shoulder note the words “collective management organization”. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All references to “licensing body” under the principal Act or any subsidiary legislation made under the principal Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be construed as references to “collective management organization”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any application for declaration made under section 27a of the principal Act which is pending before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be dealt with in accordance with the provision of the principal Act as amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any applicant that has been declared as a licensing body under subsection 27a(3) of the principal Act before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall be deemed to be declared as a collective management organization for the period of two years from the date of coming into operation of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any action under the principal Act done by a licensing body before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall remain valid from the date of coming into operation of this Act, until amended, replaced, rescinded or revoked."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the definition of “licensing body”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “author” the following definition: ‘ “authorized entity” means an entity prescribed by the Minister under subsection 13(2c);’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “performers’ right” the following definition: ‘ “person with print disability” means a person who is registered as a person with disability under the Persons with Disabilities Act 2008 [Act 685] who is— (a) blind; (b) visually impaired or has a perceptual or reading disability which cannot be improved to give visual function substantially equivalent to that of a person without such impairment or disability, and due to such impairment or disability is unable to read printed works to substantially the same degree as a person without such impairment or disability; or (c) unable to hold or manipulate a book or to focus or move the eyes, to the extent that would be normally acceptable to read due to physical disability;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “citizen” the following definition: ‘ “collective management organization” means a body corporate which is declared as a collective management organization under section 27a;’; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting before the definition of “adaptation” the following definition: ‘ “accessible format copy” means a copy of a work in an alternative manner or form which gives a person with print disability access to the work including to permit the person with print disability to have access as feasibly and comfortably as a person without such disability for his exclusive use;’. Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_v"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (gggg), by deleting the words “visually or”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (gggg) the following paragraph: “(ggggg) the making and issuing of copies of any work into an accessible format copy on such terms as the Minister may determine, by— (i) an authorized entity; or (ii) a person with print disability or any other person acting on his behalf including his caregiver;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (p), by deleting the word “and” at the end of the paragraph;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (q), by substituting for the full stop at the end of the paragraph a semi colon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (q) the following paragraphs: “(r) the importation for the purpose of distribution or making available of copies of any work in an accessible format copy by an authorized entity, the person with print disability himself or any other person acting on his behalf including his caregiver, and on such terms as the Minister may determine; and (s) the exportation for the purpose of distribution or making available of copies of any work in an accessible format copy by an authorized entity to a member of the Marrakesh Treaty and on such terms as the Minister may determine.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2 a) the following subsections: “(2b) For the purpose of paragraph 2(s), “Marrakesh Treaty” means the Marrakesh Treaty to Facilitate Access to Published Works for Persons Who Are Blind, Visually Impaired, or Otherwise Print Disabled done in Marrakesh on 27 June 2013. (2 c) For the purpose of paragraphs (2) (ggggg), (r) and (s), the Minister may by order prescribe any non-profit making body or institution which provides education, instructional training, adaptive reading or information access to a person with print disability to be an authorized entity.”. Amendment of section 16a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subparagraph 16a(3)(c)(ii) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “, or on behalf of, the body administering an institution assisting persons with a print disability solely for the purpose of the provision, whether by the institution or otherwise, of assistance to persons with a visual, aural, intellectual and print disability” the words “a person with print disability himself or any other person acting on his behalf including his caregiver, or an authorized entity or a non-profit making body or institution, solely for the purpose of assisting people who are hearing impaired or persons with print disability”. Amendment of section 25"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 25 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3a) Where a work is modified into an accessible format copy by an authorized entity, a person with print disability himself or any other person acting on his behalf including his caregiver, that modification shall not constitute a contravention of subsection (2) if the modification is necessary to make the work in an accessible format copy.”. Amendment of section 26a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
