      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2a) The application made under subsection (2) shall be accompanied with a fee as may be prescribed by the Minister.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_8__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by substituting for the words “licensing body” the words “collective management organization for a period of two years”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_8__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: “(3a) An application for a renewal of the declaration issued under subsection (3) shall be made by the collective management organization to the Controller not later than sixty days before the date of expiry of the declaration, and the application shall be— (a) made in the form and manner as may be determined by the Controller; (b) accompanied with a fee as may be prescribed by the Minister; and (c) submitted together with any information, particulars or documents as may be determined by the Controller. (3b) Any application for the renewal made after the expiry of the declaration issued under this Act shall be subject to a payment of surcharge as may be prescribed by the Minister. (3c) The date of expiry of the declaration renewed under subsection (3a) shall be stated in the declaration.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/14/eng@/~cl_8__para_f",
